# Seedship Broodtender {B}{G} 2/3: "When this creature enters, mill three cards. {3}{B}{G}, Sacrifice this creature: Return target creature or Spacecraft card from your graveyard to the battlefield.
# Activate only as a sorcery." Both players cast one on turn one and two, each milling exactly three (the top three of the library, a Spacecraft and a creature among them). On turn three the five Moxen
# pay Bot1's {3}{B}{G} exactly (the Jet's B, the Emerald's G, the rest the generic) and the sacrifice, and the ability takes its own Ornithopter back: the Black Lotus (an artifact card) and Bot2's Haywire Mite
